# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Validation run outputs.
#
# Scripts write to <tempdir>/e47-out by default (see tools/e47_outdir.py), so
# a plain run leaves the tree clean. These entries cover the case where an
# out-dir is pointed back inside the repo, and the scripts not yet routed
# through the resolver, which still emit beside themselves.
#
# To regenerate committed evidence deliberately, name the destination:
#   python3 research/e47/validation/e47_condition_lock_certificate.py \
#       --out-dir artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.e47-out/
e47-out/

